  "description_short": "Casual sports bar and grill on Plett's main road serving hearty burgers, ribs, and pub favourites.",
  "description_long": "Slops Plett brings a relaxed sports bar vibe to Melville's Centre on Plettenberg Bay's main street. The atmosphere is easygoing and unpretentious, with big screens for live sport and a menu built around comfort classics. Think flame-grilled burgers, sticky ribs, loaded nachos, and proper pub grub that hits the spot after a day at the beach or on the golf course.\n\nThe burger selection is a crowd-pleaser, with generous portions and all the usual suspects done well. Wings, platters, and steaks round out the menu, making it a solid choice for groups and families who want something filling without the fuss. The location in the heart of Plett makes it convenient for a casual lunch or dinner, and the sports bar setup means there's always a game on. It's the kind of place where you know what you're getting—no surprises, just straightforward food in a friendly setting.",
